# Project CLAUDE.md

# Agentic Development Blog Series

Technical blog series: "Agentic Development: 32 Lessons from 23,479 AI Coding Sessions" by Nick Krzemienski.

> **AUTHORITATIVE STRUCTURE DOC:** [`docs/canonical-topology.md`](docs/canonical-topology.md).
> Anything else that describes the repo layout is derived — trust the canonical doc first.
> Product schema and subdomain reservation: [`docs/product-topology.md`](docs/product-topology.md).

## Project Structure (summary — see canonical-topology.md for the full tree)

```
blog-series/
├── site/                  # Next.js 16 — git submodule → krzemienski/withagents-site
├── posts/                 # CANONICAL blog post source (synced to site/posts/ at build)
├── validationforge/       # CANONICAL VF docs source (synced to site/vf-docs/ at build)
├── scripts/               # Canonical automation (sync-vf-docs.sh, push helpers)
├── docs/
│   ├── canonical-topology.md   # AUTHORITATIVE
│   └── product-topology.md     # Product schema + subdomain reservation
├── .archive/              # Soft-delete zone (gitignored except MANIFEST + README)
├── plans/                 # Implementation plans
├── DESIGN.md              # MIRROR of /wa/ Operator Console (canonical source-of-truth)
├── wa/project/design-systems/  # CANONICAL design tokens — Operator Console + crimson #FF3D52 lock
└── stitch.json            # Stitch MCP project ID
```

The dead Astro codebase `withagents-site/` was archived on 2026-04-20 (Phase 02
of plan `260420-2229-codebase-audit-restructure`). Do not recreate it.

