# Global rule: approach-confirmation.md

# Approach Confirmation

Before implementing any change that touches more than 2 files or makes API calls:
1. Present a brief approach summary listing specific methods/endpoints/files
2. Wait for user confirmation before proceeding
3. This prevents wrong-approach false starts (wrong HTTP methods, wrong URLs, wrong SDK params)

Exception: Single-file fixes, documentation updates, and config changes can proceed directly.


