# Global rule: context-recovery.md

# Context Recovery

When resuming from context overflow, continuation, or new session:
1. Re-read the most recent progress summary or checkpoint file BEFORE taking any action
2. Do NOT invoke skills or start work until context is re-established
3. Check for `.claude/checkpoints/`, `progress.md`, or `STATE.md` files first
4. If no checkpoint exists, ask the user what was in progress


