# Global rule: project.md

# Project: yt-transition-shorts-detector

**Last Updated:** 2026-02-21
**Status:** Milestone v1.1 complete (all 15 phases shipped)

## Overview

Two separate codebases in one repo:

| Codebase | Root | Purpose |
|----------|------|---------|
| **Detection Engine** | `src/yt_shorts_detector/` | Y-pos OCR tracking → transition/stall detection |
| **Agent System** | `short_detect/` | Claude SDK orchestration + Textual TUI |

**Core value:** AI agents autonomously diagnose detection regressions, propose fixes, validate via regression gates, and roll back on failure.

## Technology Stack

- **Language:** Python 3.10+
- **Detection:** EasyOCR (GPU), OpenCV, PyTorch SSIM, scikit-image
- **Agent SDK:** Anthropic Claude Agent SDK (`query()` pattern)
- **TUI:** Textual (`GroundTruthApp` — `short_detect/tui/app.py`)
- **Video Player:** mpv (primary, JSON IPC) + FFplay (fallback)
- **Package Manager:** `uv` / `pip` (setuptools, `pyproject.toml`)

## Key Entry Points

```bash
# Detection engine
python3 -m yt_shorts_detector detect <video> <output> --detect-stalls --debug-json

# Agent system TUI
python3 -m short_detect tui

# Agent system CLI
python3 -m short_detect sweep|audit|validate|diagnose ...

# GT comparison
python3 scripts/groundtruth/compare_all_gt_vs_detection.py
```

## Directory Map

```
src/yt_shorts_detector/   Detection engine (AI agents touch this)
short_detect/             Agent system (developers touch this)
  tui/                    Textual TUI screens + widgets
  agents/                 Agent profile definitions
  hooks/                  Safety enforcement hooks
  sdk/                    Claude SDK helpers
  prompts/                Agent prompt templates
scripts/groundtruth/      GT extraction + comparison scripts
videos/*.groundtruth.json Ground truth files (80 total)
stall-test-clips/         Test clips + HeadSpin sessions
.planning/                Phase plans, roadmap, state
.claude/skills/           Project-specific skills
```

## Mandatory Session Start

**ALWAYS invoke `yt-shorts-detector-guidelines` at session start.** Contains iron rules, pitfalls, validation gates, and agent system conventions. Failure to invoke has historically wasted 60+ sessions.

## Quick Smoke Test

```bash
# After any detection engine change
python3 -m yt_shorts_detector detect \
  stall-test-clips/clips-sequential/seq_A_0-30s.mp4 \
  ./test-output --detect-stalls --debug-json
# Expected: 4 stalls, 0 errors
```

## Active Known Issues (2026-02-21)

- **Frame-0 skip bug:** 14/46 HeadSpin videos have GT starting at frame ≥1. Root cause in `extract_keyframes.py` — under investigation.
- **GT regeneration gap:** `G` key on VideoDetailScreen silently overwrites existing GT. Needs confirmation dialog before regenerating.
- **Log streaming unverified:** StreamRouter→OrchestratorBridge→AutoFocusLog chain implemented but live event rendering during agent runs has not been end-to-end verified.


